<p class="news-method">Checked 5 November 2026. Original architecture diagrams; no workstation migration, game benchmark or end-to-end hardware compatibility test. The readiness guide supplies checks, not a compatibility certificate. Living documentation and repository versions can change after this snapshot.</p></section>
